ht your accomplishments, using numbers if possible.","educationItem.degree":"Degree and Field of Study","educationItem.location":"Location","educationItem.institution":"School or University","educationItem.bullets":"Note key learnings, experience and skills gained relevant to the job.","educationItem.gpa":"4.0","educationItem.gpaText":"GPA","educationItem.maxGpa":"4.0","volunteerItem.role":"Title","volunteerItem.description":"Describe the organization or the project you worked on.","volunteerItem.institution":"Organization Name","volunteerItem.location":"Location","volunteerItem.bullets":"Describe the impact of your efforts","activityItem.title":"Project Name","activityItem.descriptionLabel":"Description","activityItem.description":"Short summary of your work","activityItem.location":"Location","activityItem.link":"URL","activityItem.bullets":"What was a successful outcome of your work? (e.g. Raised $3,000 for the charity)","achievementSection.name":"Key Achievements","achievementSection.use":"Recruiters love quantifiable results, so try to show the scale & scope of your top achievements.","activitySection.name":"Projects","activitySection.use":"Highlight personal, professional, or academic activities and demonstrate the outcome of your efforts (e.g. fundraised $3,000 for charity).","additionalExperienceSection.name":"Additional Experience","additionalExperienceSection.use":"Keep your experience section concise & easily readable for recruiters. Try to show the impact of your work, rather than list the duties. Include metrics & KPIs whenever possible.","additionalTechnologySection.name":"Additional Skills","additionalTechnologySection.use":"ATS tip: Make sure all skills listed in the job ad are listed in this section.","addressSection.name":"address","addressSection.use":"Add here the Address of the recipient of your Cover Letter","awardSection.name":"Awards","awardSection.use":"List awards, honors, scholarships, accomplishments you earned to show you are above the average standards in the respective field.","bookSection.name":"Books","bookItem.imageLabel":"Upload cover","bookSection.use":"Feature your favorite books: a great way to connect with recruiters on a human level.","customSection.name":"Custom","customSection.use":"Rename this section & use it to provide extra information.","languageSection.name":"Languages","languageSection.use":"List the languages you know and what your proficiency in each of them is.","passionSection.name":"Interests","passionSection.use":"This helps recruiters see that you are a good fit for the company culture.","publicationSection.name":"Publications","additionalPublicationSection.name":"Additional Publications","publicationSection.use":"List papers, articles or books you have published.","skillSection.name":"Industry Expertise","skillSection.use":"Emphasize your core competencies in a visual way.","socialSection.name":"Find me online","socialSection.use":"List your social media profiles.","talentSection.name":"Strengths","talentSection.use":"Direct the attention of the recruiter to 2 or 3 of your unique strengths.","technologySection.name":"Skills","technologySection.use":"ATS tip: Make sure all skills listed in the job ad are listed in this section.","certificateSection.name":"Certifications","certificateItem.issuerLabel":"Issuer","certificateSection.use":"List all your certificates that are relevant to your next desired role, company, or industry.","courseSection.name":"Training / Courses","courseSection.use":"Keep your resume compact: only include courses relevant to the role you are applying for.","dayofmylifeSection.name":"My time","dayofmylifeSection.use":"Stand out with a highly visual section. Show hiring managers how you spend your time.","educationSection.name":"Education","educationSection.use":"List the latest 1 or 2 degrees you have - mentioning your GPA is usually not necessary.","experienceSection.name":"Experience","experienceSection.use":"Keep your experience section concise & easily readable for recruiters. Try to show the impact of your work, rather than list the duties. Include metrics & KPIs whenever possible.","quoteSection.name":"My Life Philosophy","quoteSection.use":"Include a quote that inspires you and help recruiters understand your work style & personality.","referenceSection.name":"References","referenceSection.use":"List professionals who you\'ve worked with and who would genuinely vouch for your skills and accomplishments. Make sure they are comfortable to be your reference.","summarySection.name":"Summary","summarySection.use":"Recruiters prefer a short, tailored summary section that is relevant to the job. Focus on your unique strengths & show passion for the role.","volunteerSection.name":"Volunteering","volunteerItem.descriptionLabel":"Description","volunteerSection.use":"Show you care for others & society: recruiters love hiring people who go above & beyond.","dateRangeField.placeholder":"Date period","dateRangeField.onGoing":"Present","removeBrandTooltip.text":"Remove branding","placeholderSection.addNew":"Add new section","editUi.summaryLimit":"To continue please delete a line or add a new entry from the pop-up menu.","editUi.bulletsLimit":"You seem to have too many bullets in this entry. We recommend that you focus on your top achievements and most impactful work. Our research shows that having less than 8 bullets is optimal.","editUi.bulletsSymbolLimit":"You\'ve reached the limit of bullet chars. We encourage you to focus on your top achievements and impacts.","editUi.actions.addRow":"Add Row","editUi.actions.addColumn":"Add Column","editUi.actions.moveRowUp":"Move Row Up","editUi.actions.moveRowDown":"Move Row Down","editUi.actions.deleteRow":"Delete Row","editUi.actions.moveColumnLeft":"Move Column to Left","editUi.actions.moveColumnRight":"Move Column to Right","editUi.actions.deleteColumn":"Delete Column","footer.enhancv.url":"www.enhancv.com","footer.resumementor.url":"www.resumementor.com","footer.poweredBy":